            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Nexa 1.0.4</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Security updates for the built-in Tor: newer versions of the libraries it uses to decompress network data and to check certificates when connecting through Snowflake, and a fix for a timing leak in one of its encryption helpers.</li>
</ul>
<p>Nothing changes in how Nexa looks or works.</p>
